<title>FINLAND: ASPO 1996 PROFIT FALLS 33 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>ASPO 1996 PROFIT FALLS 33 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax    65.5 vs 97.6</p>
